    {
      "tipo": "explicacion",
      "titulo": {"en": "Your turn: write and speak"},
      "texto": {
        "en": "**The app cannot check this part.** For the writing, please use pen and paper. For the speaking, say it out loud and, if you can, practise with a native speaker or a teacher who can correct you.\n\n**Write (60–80 words).** Write six questions about things in your home and answer them with lo, la, los, las: ¿Dónde tienes las llaves? Las tengo en…\n\n**Speak (about 1 minute).** Answer aloud without repeating the noun: ¿Ves la tele? ¿Lees el periódico? ¿Conoces a mis padres?"
      }
    }
  ]
